TEST: -p window is preserved in attach suggestion
INPUT_DISPLAY: 'screen' '-p' '2' '-r' 'work' '--dry-run'
ACTUAL_EXIT: 3
OUTPUT_DISPLAY_BEGIN
screen2tmux: APPROX: Screen -r resumes a detached Screen session and normally refuses an already attached session; tmux attach-session normally permits an additional client.
screen2tmux: suggestion: Closest substitute: tmux attach-session -t work:2. Use Screen -x semantics when multiple simultaneous clients are intended, or -d -r when detaching an existing attachment first.
OUTPUT_DISPLAY_END
OUTPUT_HEX: 
