TEST: removebuf does not delete tmux buffer
INPUT_DISPLAY: 'screen' '-S' 'work' '-X' 'removebuf' '--dry-run'
ACTUAL_EXIT: 2
OUTPUT_DISPLAY_BEGIN
screen2tmux: UNSUPPORTED: Screen removebuf deletes Screen's exchange file (BufferFile); it does not delete the in-memory copy buffer, so tmux delete-buffer would perform a different operation.
screen2tmux: suggestion: If you intended to remove Screen's exchange file, remove that file explicitly. If you intended to clear a tmux paste buffer, use tmux delete-buffer deliberately.
OUTPUT_DISPLAY_END
OUTPUT_HEX: 
